# ============================= 6. Infra =============================

## Environment Variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

## Secrets / Keys
*.pem
*.key
HorongHorong/Config/Secrets.xcconfig

## Security Scan Reports
trivy-reports/


# ========================= 7. Documentation ==========================

## Project Documentation (internal/draft)
docs/*
!docs/updates/
docs/updates/*
!docs/updates/appcast.xml

# 골든셋 실행 마커 / 결과 (로컬 산출물)
Evals/.run-golden
Evals/results/*
!Evals/results/baselines/
Evals/results/baselines/*
!Evals/results/baselines/*/
Evals/results/baselines/*/*
!Evals/results/baselines/*/manifest.json
promptfooconfig.json
Evals/.provider
Evals/.goal-eval-configuration.json
Evals/report/eval-report.html
